as an optional dependency. They contain no Tau source. Tau is distributed under
the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Alejandro AO.

Bundled theme palette data
--------------------------

src/superqode/data/themes/halcyon-rivet.json and saffron-cavern.json are
palette data from awesome-pi-themes 1.2.19, Copyright (c) 2026 Isashi Mitsui:
https://github.com/isashi/awesome-pi-themes
The complete MIT license is included alongside them as AWESOME-PI-LICENSE.
The offline catalog at src/superqode/data/theme-library/ includes all 71 JSON
palettes from revision a268b1aca442d348705e7733dc3db9af927079e0 of the same
collection, with its complete MIT license alongside the palette files.

ayu-light.json and ayu-mirage.json are palette data from pi-ayu-themes:
https://github.com/iodic/pi-ayu-themes
The upstream MIT license is included alongside them as AYU-LICENSE.

Only JSON palette data is bundled. Upstream TypeScript extensions are not
included or executed by the palette importer.
